e prices. Located in Kandivali, it provides a royal lifestyle experience with its exquisite apartments. Despite being in the heart of the city, these apartments offer a peaceful getaway from the hustle and bustle. Enjoy luxurious living in a serene environment away from the city noise. The project's prime location in Kandivali ensures excellent connectivity to important landmarks, hospitals, educational institutions, supermarkets, parks, entertainment spots, and recreational centres. Experience the convenience of living in a well-connected and vibrant neighbourhood at Kenny Kashi Bhuvan.\n\nConfiguration\n\n1 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2024\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹28,976/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n428 - 442 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Three open side properties\n* Tree plantation\n* Exclusive life at a futuristic destination\n\n* Landscaped gardens\n* Children's play area\n* Access to important landmarks\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/Entrance-Lobby-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Entrance-Lobby-secondary.svg)\n\nEntrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/Entrance-Lob