e earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nKenny Kashi Bhuvanis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800049342](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800049342)\n\nKashi Bhuvan\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Kenny Kashi Bhuvan?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Kenny Kashi Bhuvan is 31 Dec 2024\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Kenny Kashi Bhuvan?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Kenny Kashi Bhuvan is 428 - 442 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Kenny Kashi Bhuvan?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Kenny Kashi Bhuvan is ₹1.25 Cr - 1.29 Cr\n\n### Where is Kenny Kashi Bhuvan located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nKenny Kashi Bhuvan is located at Kashi Bhuvan, Dahanukar Wadi, Mahavir Nagar, Chandavarkar Roadkandivali, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, 400067.\n\n### What configurations are available in Kenny Kashi Bhuvan?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nKenny Kashi Bhuvan has 1 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Kenny Kashi Bhuvan?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Kenny Kashi Bhuvan is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Kenny Kashi Bhuvan?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Entrance Lobby, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Kenny Kashi Bhuvan?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Kenny Kashi Bhuvan is Kenny 23 Developers.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Kenny Kashi Bhuvan:Kenny 23 Developers](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/060623065649-newproject-2023-06-06t185613750.webp)\n\n## Kenny 23 Developers\n\nKenny 23 Developers is a prominent name in the Mumbai real estate industry, known for their exceptional contributions. With a commitment to transforming dreams into reality, they have assisted numerous individuals in owning their own homes. Their approach to construction is meticulous, emphasizing quality, thoughtful detailing, and providing value for money. The company strives to cultivate trust and confidence among its customers by consistently delivering excellence with every new product and service they introduce. Kenny 23 Developers aims to create a lasting impact on the lives of people, making their aspirations of owning a home a tangible and fulfilling experience.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/je-vee-infrastructure-shree-gopaldham-elevation-1762949548.jpg)\n\n![Shree Gopaldham](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/240522105543-jeeandvee.png)\n\nShree Gopaldham\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.45 Cr - 5.64 Cr\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rudra-amar-group-shivani-rudram-elevation-1755173792.jpg)\n\n![Shivani Rudram](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/260525085623-newproject-2025-05-26t205415973.webp)\n\nShivani Rudram\n\nKandivali